1
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:26,683
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:33,698
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:40,709
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,047 --> 00:00:47,056
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:51,188
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,490
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,787 --> 00:00:59,022
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:03,915
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:07,099
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:12,191
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,191 --> 00:01:16,771
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,771 --> 00:01:18,770
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,973 --> 00:01:24,755
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,139 --> 00:01:29,450
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:31,958
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,204 --> 00:01:42,421
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,871 --> 00:01:48,705
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,623
=Episode 24=

19
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:55,959
You and I have always been one.

20
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:59,920
Now my time has come to an end.

21
00:02:03,799 --> 00:02:05,000
You are right.

22
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:12,840
This is the retribution I must bear.

23
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:47,560
Suddenly, I miss the days
we used to drink together.

24
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:51,199
You could always outdrink me.

25
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,800
As the Diamond Sutra says,

26
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,879
"The past mind cannot be grasped,

27
00:03:57,319 --> 00:03:59,879
the present mind cannot be grasped,

28
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:04,599
and the future mind cannot be grasped."

29
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,919
What's past

30
00:04:08,319 --> 00:04:10,039
has faded away,

31
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:14,120
and the future is nothing
but a castle in the air.

32
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:16,759
Better seize the present

33
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:20,399
and cherish the one before you.

34
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,600
Fahai.

35
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,279
Fahai.

36
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:56,240
Xu Xian.

37
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,680
Xu Xian.

38
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,800
Suzhen.

39
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:09,639
I wonder
if you've passed your love trial.

40
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:16,399
Hang in there.

41
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:17,959
I'll heal you right now.

42
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:25,000
Xu Xian.

43
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:26,879
It's useless.

44
00:05:28,759 --> 00:05:30,439
When winter comes,

45
00:05:32,879 --> 00:05:34,759
I won't be able to hold you anymore.

46
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:49,079
Next time, it'll be my turn
to hold the umbrella for you.

47
00:05:53,439 --> 00:05:54,439
It's a promise.

48
00:05:56,399 --> 00:05:57,839
You can't break it.

49
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:03,519
Xu Xian.

50
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:05,920
Xu Xian.

51
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:08,879
Xu Xian.

52
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,120
Abbot Fahai,

53
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:32,000
how do you interpret this fortune stick?

54
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:37,265
(Stick 14)

55
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:39,759
Keep kindness in your heart,

56
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,920
walk the righteous path,

57
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:44,040
and you will reach the other shore.

58
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:03,079
Madam has given birth!

59
00:08:03,279 --> 00:08:04,319
It's a boy!

60
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:06,439
How is my wife?

61
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,160
Everything's fine.

62
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:09,800
Have you thought of a name?

63
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,160
Not yet.

64
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:13,720
Father, how about naming him Xu Xian?

65
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:19,600
(Xu Xian? Why Xu Xian?)

66
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:43,720
May I ask your name, Miss?

67
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,480
Bai Suzhen.

68
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,440
I am Xu Xian.

69
00:08:48,919 --> 00:08:50,600
I wonder how to repay your kindness.

70
00:08:52,559 --> 00:08:55,120
Just do as the storybooks said,

71
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,559
marry me in return.

72
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:00,799
A person like me
doesn't deserve a happy match.

73
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,639
I spent all my savings

74
00:09:05,639 --> 00:09:06,919
to buy that house for you.

75
00:09:07,639 --> 00:09:10,919
Now, I can't even afford an inn.

76
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,720
I'm staying at your place.

77
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:15,279
I don't deserve your kindness.

78
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:16,799
Please leave.

79
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:21,279
We've spent so much time together,

80
00:09:21,279 --> 00:09:22,679
a man and a woman alone in a room.

81
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,480
Word gets out, bad for your name.

82
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,759
Why do you keep criticizing me?

83
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:29,159
Don't you care if I got hurt?

84
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:35,600
Well, are you hurt?

85
00:09:38,023 --> 00:09:43,805
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

86
00:09:43,805 --> 00:09:50,068
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

87
00:09:50,378 --> 00:09:56,737
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

88
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,080
Does it look good?

89
00:10:01,519 --> 00:10:02,519
Yes.

90
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,799
Bow to heaven and earth.

91
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:16,039
Since we have drunk the nuptial wine,

92
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,720
we are a real married couple now.

93
00:10:24,888 --> 00:10:30,541
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

94
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,639
Though I didn't do it,

95
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,480
they did die because of me.

96
00:10:37,919 --> 00:10:38,919
I'm sorry.

97
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:47,759
(Xu Xian, I'm sorry.)

98
00:10:48,639 --> 00:10:50,000
I don't expect your forgiveness,

99
00:10:50,679 --> 00:10:53,840
but I hope you can let go
of your obsession with revenge.

100
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:07,039
Suzhen, you've underestimated
how much you mean to Xu Xian.

101
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:10,399
When your evil self
trapped you in the mural,

102
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:15,360
(Xu Xian was the first
to notice something was wrong.)

103
00:11:16,559 --> 00:11:18,879
(He also risked his life)

104
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:21,080
(to save you
with the Du'e Ancient Scroll.)

105
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:26,759
The injuries on him were from saving me?

106
00:11:28,679 --> 00:11:30,399
(Since you need me for your trial,)

107
00:11:31,039 --> 00:11:32,519
(then I'll use you once too.)

108
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,480
(From now on, I need you)

109
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,480
(by my side at all times.)

110
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,519
(Without my permission,)

111
00:11:39,559 --> 00:11:41,320
you can't take one step away from me.

112
00:11:46,799 --> 00:11:47,919
Can you really bear

113
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:51,519
to walk away like this?

114
00:11:53,159 --> 00:11:57,217
What about your love trial?

115
00:11:57,217 --> 00:12:03,480
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

116
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:10,149
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

117
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:17,687
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

118
00:12:17,972 --> 00:12:23,519
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

119
00:12:23,946 --> 00:12:29,679
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

120
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:32,279
Suzhen,

121
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:33,919
I've finally taken human form.

122
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:37,320
Qing,

123
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:40,679
will you return
to the mortal realm with me

124
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:42,960
to go through my unfinished trial?

125
00:12:44,679 --> 00:12:46,440
Wherever you go, I'll follow.

126
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:52,548
♪Having ever loved♪

127
00:13:37,533 --> 00:13:41,692
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

128
00:13:44,159 --> 00:13:48,537
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

129
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:55,905
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

130
00:13:56,674 --> 00:14:01,141
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

131
00:14:04,006 --> 00:14:08,447
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

132
00:14:10,643 --> 00:14:15,373
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

133
00:14:16,585 --> 00:14:22,698
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

134
00:14:23,361 --> 00:14:29,143
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

135
00:14:29,143 --> 00:14:35,406
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

136
00:14:35,716 --> 00:14:42,075
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

137
00:14:42,246 --> 00:14:49,613
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

138
00:14:49,898 --> 00:14:55,445
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

139
00:14:55,936 --> 00:15:02,146
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

140
00:15:02,456 --> 00:15:09,229
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

141
00:15:10,226 --> 00:15:15,879
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

142
00:15:16,713 --> 00:15:21,121
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

143
00:15:21,886 --> 00:15:24,474
♪Having ever loved♪
